---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/pages.css";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="retro-page">
    <Header activePage="about" />

    <main class="rpg-style">
      <div class="pixel-box dialog-box" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <h1
          class="text-retro-highlight"
          style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"
        >&gt; USER MANUAL v1.0
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 2;">
          WELCOME, PLAYER.<br /><br />
          COOKIE CHALLENGE IS A DAILY QUEST SYSTEM ENCAPSULATED IN A DIGITAL FORTUNE COOKIE.<br /><br />
          IT DOES NOT MATTER IF THE QUEST IS BIG OR SMALL. THE IMPORTANT THING IS TO COMPLETE IT AND LEVEL UP IN REAL LIFE.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Instruction Steps -->
      <div
        class="pixel-box"
        style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-color: var(--cookie-light);"
      >
        <h2
          style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--cookie-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
        >
          [HOW TO PLAY]
        </h2>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num text-retro-highlight">01.</div>
          <div class="step-text">
            <strong>VISIT THE COOKIE SECTION</strong><br />
            ENTER THE MAIN NAVIGATION MENU.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num text-retro-highlight">02.</div>
          <div class="step-text">
            <strong>CLICK TO OPEN</strong><br />
            THE COOKIE WILL REVEAL THE QUEST OF THE DAY.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num text-retro-highlight">03.</div>
          <div class="step-text">
            <strong>WAIT FOR THE NEXT TURN</strong><br />
            THE SERVER RESETS EVERY MIDNIGHT. ONLY ONE QUEST PER DAY.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num text-retro-highlight">04.</div>
          <div class="step-text">
            <strong>BUILD YOUR STREAK</strong><br />
            COME BACK DAILY TO BUILD YOUR FIRE STREAK AND UNLOCK BADGES.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- System Specs -->
      <div class="pixel-box" style="text-align: center;">
        <h2
          style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--cookie-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
        >
          [SYSTEM SPECIFICATIONS]
        </h2>
        <div
          style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;"
        >
          <span class="tech-tag">ASTRO V.5</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">TAILWIND 4</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">CSS PIXEL ART ENGINE</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <a href="/cookies" class="pixel-btn"> ▶ START GAME</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="retro-footer">
      (C) 2026 COOKIE CHALLENGE SYSTEM
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
